{"about_the_game":"Dumb Little Robots is a 2d puzzle game where you control robots that each have a single function. Help them work together to solve tricky levels. Meet new robots as you go and learn how they change the possibilities!<br><br>Start simply...<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896720/extras/FirstLevel_Gif.gif?t=1694579822\" /><br><br>Get complex!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896720/extras/HardLevel_Gif.gif?t=1694579822\" /><br><br>Levels play out on grids, and primarily feature pushing, rotating, destroying, and copying robots to solve.<br><br>If you find yourself stuck, DON'T PANIC. This game features a hint button! And then panic anyway, as you may find the assistance sometimes less than helpful.<br><br>Includes 51 levels, divided between 6 tutorial levels and 45 main levels. Levels are clustered into groups of 9 that can be completed in any order.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Minimal Effort","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1896720/70eaa9feff38b3ea0c38101c3bd5ce0e1dbea5f7.jpg"},{"name":"Not So Bad","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1896720/fece3c6dcb86930b87af4142cef97f9715b17987.jpg"},{"name":"Maybe You ARE Trying","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1896720/aa340b987d5a9ddc6d70b4a102ccee9553949a5c.jpg"},{"name":"Maybe You're Just Lucky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1896720/903751a827297fa59000adb07ed2129cfd820a20.jpg"},{"name":"You're Almost There","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1896720/d97a5291820650de9821cdcad7b7014ea6843b36.jpg"},{"name":"Smart Little Robot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1896720/223836cdbf278b7ee75c7c341eecd5c67143acc0